  "content": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"bg-center bg-cover wb-init wb-bgimg-inited\" data-bgimg-srcset=\"img/1x1.png 991w, /content/dam/cwa-ace/images/cwa-landing-page/banniere-fleuve-saint-laurent-grands-lacs-1200x250.png 992w\" id=\"wb-auto-4\" style='background-image: url(\"/content/dam/cwa-ace/images/cwa-landing-page/banniere-fleuve-saint-laurent-grands-lacs-1200x250.png\");'>\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row mrgn-bttm-md\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-7\">\n\t\t\t\t<h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\">Canada Water Agency</h1>\n\t\t\t\t<p>The Canada Water Agency works with provinces, territories, Indigenous peoples, local authorities, scientists and others to find the best ways to keep our water safe, clean and well-managed for future generations. </p>\n\t\t\t\n<a class=\"btn btn-call-to-action\" href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/news/advanced-news-search/news-results.html?_=1712692197091&amp;typ=&amp;dprtmnt=canadawateragency&amp;mnstr=&amp;start=&amp;end\">Read the latest news</a>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"provisional gc-featured-link wb-init gc-featured-link-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-5\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Featured</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"stretched-link\" href=\"https://www.pm.gc.ca/en/news/news-releases/2026/03/31/prime-minister-carney-launches-new-nature-strategy-protect-canadas\">Prime Minister Carney launches new nature strategy to protect Canada’s natural environment</a></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n    <div class=\"provisional bg-info\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Featured</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mrgn-tp-sm\"><a class=\"stretched-link\" href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canada-water-agency/news/2026/03/statement-on-world-water-day-by-the-honourable-julie-dabrusin-minister-of-environment-climate-change-and-nature-and-the-minister-responsible-for-th.html\"><strong>Statement on World Water Day by the Honourable Julie Dabrusin, Minister of Environment, Climate Change and Nature, and the Minister responsible for the Canada Water Agency</strong></a></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"gc-most-requested\"><div class=\"container\">\n    <h2>Most requested</h2>\n    <ul><li><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/funding/ecoaction-community-program.html\">EcoAction</a></li>\n     <li><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/freshwater-ecosystem-initiatives/great-lakes/great-lakes-protection/areas-concern.html\">Great Lakes: Areas of Concern</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul></div>\n</section></div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"container mrgn-bttm-lg\">\n\t<section class=\"gc-srvinfo\"><h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Services and information</h2><div class=\"wb-eqht row wb-init wb-eqht-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-6\">\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/freshwater-ecosystem-initiatives.html\">Freshwater Ecosystem Initiatives</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t <p>Supporting regionally specific actions to restore and protect water quality and ecosystem health in waterbodies of national significance.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/freshwater-policy.html\">Freshwater policy</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t <p>Providing policy expertise to support the Freshwater Action Plan and respond to freshwater issues.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/freshwater-action-plan.html\">Freshwater Action Plan</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Advancing efforts to manage, restore, and protect Canada’s fresh water.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/canada-water-act-review.html\">Canada Water Act review</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t <p>Reviewing the <em>Canada Water Act</em> to reflect Canada’s freshwater realities.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/freshwater-stewardship.html\">Freshwater stewardship</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t <p>Working with partners and stakeholders to advance the Freshwater Action Plan and build a strong approach to fresh water management.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/indigenous-collaboration.html\">Indigenous collaboration</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Working with First Nations, Inuit, and Métis partners on freshwater policy, data, freshwater ecosystem initiatives, and other efforts.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/inter-jurisdictional-transboundary-water-boards.html\">Inter-jurisdictional transboundary water boards</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Focusing on water issues that have implications for more than one province, territory or country.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/science.html\">Freshwater-related science</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Supporting and leveraging freshwater science to enhance freshwater outcomes.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/data-collaboration.html\">Freshwater data collaboration</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Improving freshwater data management in Canada to enhance understanding and inform decisions.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 187px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/funding.html\">Funding opportunities</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Explore the Canada Water Agency's freshwater-related funding opportunities and access useful resources.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 187px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/water-one-window.html\">Water One Window</a></h3>\n<p><span class=\"label label-info\">New</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t <p>Find federal information, resources, and programs to support the stewardship of fresh water in Canada.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t</section></div>\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"well well-sm brdr-0 mrgn-bttm-md\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<section><h2>Contact us</h2>\n<h3><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/corporate/contact.html\">Canada Water Agency</a></h3>\n<div class=\"0 mrgn-bttm-md\">510-234 Donald Street\n<div class=\"0 mrgn-bttm-md\">Winnipeg, Manitoba\n<div class=\"0 mrgn-bttm-md\">R3C 1M8\n<div class=\"0 mrgn-bttm-md\">Canada\n\n<div class=\"0 mrgn-bttm-md\"><p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:water-eau@cwa-aec.gc.ca\">water-eau@cwa-aec.gc.ca</a></p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div></div></div></div></section></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-8\"><section><h2>About the Canada Water Agency</h2>\n\t<ul class=\"list-unstyled bold-content mrgn-tp-lg lst-spcd-2 colcount-md-2\"><li><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/corporate/mandate.html\">Mandate</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/corporate/transparency.html\">Transparency</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/corporate/transparency/priorities.html\">Priorities and management</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/corporate/accessibility.html\">Accessibility</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/corporate/jobs.html\">Job opportunities</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/corporate/transparency/acts-regulations.html\">Compliance</a></li>\n\t\t<li>More: <a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/corporate/mandate.html#do\">About the CWA</a></li>\n\t</ul></section></div>\n\n<div class=\"col-md-4\"><section class=\"gc-followus\"><h2>On social media</h2>\n\t<ul><li>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://x.com/WaterAgencyCAN\" rel=\"external\" class=\"x-social\">Canada Water Agency</a>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/canada-water-agency\" rel=\"external\" class=\"linkedin\">Canada Water Agency</a>\n\t\t</li>\n<li>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/EnvironmentandNaturalResourcesinCanada/\" rel=\"external\" class=\"facebook\">Environment and Natural Resources in Canada</a>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul></section></div></div></div>\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwscolumns section\">\n\n    <div class=\"row \">\n        \n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"mwscolumns section\">\n           \n        <div class=\"row mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-xl\">\n            \n                <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n                    <div class=\"mwsbodytext text parbase section\"> \n    \n        <h3 class=\"mrgn-tp-0\">Minister</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/government/ministers/julie-dabrusin.html\"><img src=\"/content/dam/cwa-ace/images/cwa-landing-page/Dabrusin%20-%20small_200x200.jpg\" alt=\"Minister Dabrusin wearing a pink blazer\" class=\"img-responsive thumbnail\"><strong>The Honourable<br> Julie Dabrusin</strong></a></p>\n<p class=\"mrgn-tp-sm\">Minister of the Environment, Climate Change and Nature</p>\n</div>        </div>         \n                <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n                    <div class=\"mwsbodytext text parbase section\"> \n        <h3 class=\"mrgn-tp-0\">Management</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/en/canada-water-agency/corporate/organizational-structure.html#mark\"><img src=\"/content/dam/cwa-ace/images/cwa-landing-page/25003.12-Mark%20Fisher-9104043_web.jpg\" alt=\"Mark Fisher wearing glasses and a tie\" class=\"img-responsive thumbnail\"><strong>Mark Fisher</strong></a></p>\n<p class=\"mrgn-tp-sm\">President of the Canada Water Agency</p>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t<section class=\"provisional wb-feeds gc-feeds limit-3 col-md-4 wb-init wb-feeds-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-7\"><h2 class=\"h3\">News</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"feeds-cont list-unstyled lst-spcd\"><li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a data-ajax=\"https://api.io.canada.ca/io-server/gc/news/en/v2?dept=canadawateragency&amp;sort=publishedDate&amp;orderBy=desc&amp;publishedDate%3E=2024-01-01&amp;pick=100\" href=\"https://api.io.canada.ca/io-server/gc/news/en/v2?dept=canadawateragency&amp;sort=publishedDate&amp;orderBy=desc&amp;publishedDate%3E=2024-01-01&amp;pick=100&amp;format=atom&amp;atomtitle=Canada%20News%20Centre%20-%20Canada%20and%20Water%20Agency\" rel=\"external\" id=\"wb-auto-8\">Canada Water Agency news releases</a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul><p>More: <a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/news/advanced-news-search/news-results.html?_=1712692197091&amp;dprtmnt=canadawateragency&amp;start=&amp;end=\"><abbr title=\"Canada Water Agency\">CWA</abbr> news</a></p>\n\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n            </div>